      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "im against this as well. one of the joys of exploring maps is climbing. granted, i hate injuring my controllers with spamming the jump button, but unless they come up with a real climbing mechanic that applies automatically to all maps, Id rather keep our crunchy climbing abilities for now. if anything perhaps a new sdk plugin that you can add a \"nonclimbing\" component to map models?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
