      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm against this as it might break flying avatars as well. There is give and take here which compromises other content creator's as well. If this were to be patched out and no longer worked with flying colliders on avatar's, then you would be taking away creative freedom from other content creators who make complicated flight systems for avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
