      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "would probably be a better idea to make the legacy locomotion default  and simply add the option for newer ones for use in things such as game maps.\nI can already forsee tons of maps breaking with this change, especially older ones.\nalso I forsee a lot of maps becoming really really boring with the new and \"\"\"improved\"\"\" stuff.\nno more hanging out on the roof of a building instead of the intended areas, no more exploring maps not specifically designed for it.\nlet's patch the fun out of vrchat why don't we.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
