      "value": "@{5ba749f34dca6b351d658330|full_name}: tupper is right about LEGACY LOCOMOTION, but it seems to me that there are many more attractive ways to move around now that various scripts have been created by UDON.\nRather than using legacy locomotion, which does not have a good feel when moving, I think it would be a better experience to look for a UDON script for the movement assistance system.\n(like levitation, for example).",
